      "content": "It cut off mid-sentence. Please continue from where you left off, but try to expand much more on everything. \n\nWhen you're explaining a step, don't just say \"do X,\" explain the technical reasoning behind why X is important, the potential consequences of not doing it, and maybe add some extra context about how networking works in general. The audit team really needs to see that depth to justify the high word count. Just keep going and be as exhaustive as possible.",
